# Drop a paper PDF here to generate an insight.
#
# Layout:  interest/<slug>/paper.pdf   (you add this; push it)
# The GitHub Action then adds, in a PR:
#   interest/<slug>/paper.md     (extracted main text)
#   interest/<slug>/.sha256      (change-detection guard)
#   assets/figures/<slug>/...    (a representative figure, when extractable)
#   _insights/<date>-<slug>.md   (the generated insight that renders as a card)
